{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And a spirit passes over him.</b> Before the seclusion." "<b>A spirit of jealousy, and he is jealous.</b> Our Rabbis explained: a term of warning — that he warns her, 'Do not seclude yourself with a certain man.'" "<b>And she is defiled, or a spirit passes over him, etc.</b> That is, he warned her, and she transgressed his warning, and it is not known whether she was defiled or not."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:29.046447286Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}